<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Careers | REVIVO</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/user/header') %>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#2C2C2C]">Join Our Team</h1>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f8f7f5] via-[#f8c78d]/20 to-[#f8f7f5] p-8 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#2C2C2C] mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Work With Purpose</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        At REVIVO, we're building a team of passionate individuals who share our vision for thoughtful, heritage-inspired fashion. We believe that great products come from great people, and we're committed to creating a workplace where creativity, collaboration, and personal growth thrive.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Whether you're a designer with an eye for vintage details, a sustainability expert with fresh ideas, or a retail professional who loves connecting with customers, there could be a place for you in our growing REVIVO family.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-[#f8c78d]/10 rounded-full"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-[#f8c78d]/10 rounded-full"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10 p-8 border border-[#2C2C2C]/10 rounded-lg shadow-sm bg-white">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 11c0 3.517-1.009 6.799-2.753 9.571m-3.44-2.04l.054-.09A13.916 13.916 0 008 11a4 4 0 118 0c0 1.017-.07 2.019-.203 3m-2.118 6.844A21.88 21.88 0 0015.171 17m3.839 1.132c.645-2.266.99-4.659.99-7.132A8 8 0 008 4.07M3 15.364c.64-1.319 1-2.8 1-4.364 0-1.457.39-2.823 1.07-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Core Values</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2C2C2C]/5 to-[#f8c78d]/20 rounded-lg blur-sm"></div>
            <div class="relative bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-[#2C2C2C]/10">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Respect for Heritage</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                We honor the craftsmanship and design principles of the past while creating something new and relevant for today.
              </p>
              
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Thoughtful Innovation</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                We embrace change and new ideas, but always with purpose and consideration for our core values.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f8c78d]/20 to-[#2C2C2C]/5 rounded-lg blur-sm"></div>
            <div class="relative bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-[#2C2C2C]/10">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Sustainability Mindset</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                We consider the environmental and social impact of every decision we make, from design to delivery.
              </p>
              
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Community Connection</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-11">
                We value the relationships we build with our customers, partners, and each other, creating a supportive network that extends beyond business.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Benefits of Working at REVIVO</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8v13m0-13V6a2 2 0 112 2h-2zm0 0V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 109.5 8H12zm-7 4h14M5 12a2 2 0 110-4h14a2 2 0 110 4M5 12v7a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-7"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Employee Discount</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Generous discounts on all REVIVO products to help you build your own sustainable wardrobe.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Flexible Work</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Options for remote work and flexible scheduling to support work-life balance.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Learning Budget</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Annual stipend for professional development and skill-building opportunities.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Health & Wellness</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Comprehensive health benefits and wellness programs to support your physical and mental wellbeing.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Growth Opportunities</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Clear pathways for advancement and regular feedback to help you develop your career.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Team Events</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Regular social activities, team-building events, and celebrations to foster connection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Current Openings</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Senior Product Designer</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Full-time • Remote</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded">New</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            We're looking for an experienced product designer with a passion for vintage-inspired fashion to lead the development of our Prime Layers collection.
          </p>
          <a href="/careers/senior-product-designer" class="inline-block text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">View Details →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">E-Commerce Specialist</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Full-time • Hybrid</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Join our digital team to help optimize the online shopping experience and drive growth across our e-commerce platforms.
          </p>
          <a href="/careers/ecommerce-specialist" class="inline-block text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">View Details →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Sustainability Coordinator</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Full-time • On-site</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Help advance our sustainability initiatives by coordinating with suppliers, implementing eco-friendly practices, and measuring our environmental impact.
          </p>
          <a href="/careers/sustainability-coordinator" class="inline-block text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">View Details →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Don't see a position that matches your skills? We're always interested in connecting with talented individuals who share our values.
        </p>
        <a href="/careers/general-application" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Submit a General Application →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Hiring Process</h2>
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <ol class="relative border-l border-gray-300 ml-6 mb-8">
          <li class="mb-8 ml-8">
            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full -left-4 ring-4 ring-white">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white rounded-full text-sm">1</span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#2C2C2C]">Application Review</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Our team carefully reviews all applications and reaches out to candidates whose experience and skills align with our needs.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-8 ml-8">
            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full -left-4 ring-4 ring-white">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white rounded-full text-sm">2</span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#2C2C2C]">Initial Interview</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">A conversation with our HR team to discuss your background, experience, and fit with our company culture.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-8 ml-8">
            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full -left-4 ring-4 ring-white">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white rounded-full text-sm">3</span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#2C2C2C]">Skills Assessment</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Depending on the role, you may be asked to complete a practical assessment related to the position.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ml-8">
            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full -left-4 ring-4 ring-white">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white rounded-full text-sm">4</span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#2C2C2C]">Team Interview</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Meet with the team you'll be working with to discuss specific role responsibilities and get to know potential colleagues.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-8">
        <a href="/contact" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300">Contact HR</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
